# WSQ assessment materials (confidential — never pushed)
# Question papers AND answer keys are trainer/assessor material and live on
# Google Drive only. They must never reach GitHub.
/assessment/
/assessment\ /

# The assessment BUILDER carries this course's live questions and model answers
# inline, so publishing it leaks the paper just as the DOCX would. The generic
# template (build_wsq_assessment.py) and the SKILL.md stay, so the toolchain is
# still reproducible for a new course.
.claude/skills/wsq-assessment/build_assessment.py

